  text: '<p class="fr"><b>1.</b> Comparer <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">3</span></span> + <span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">7</span></span></span> et <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">10</span></span></span>. <br><b>2.</b> Comparer <span class="m nw">1 + <span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">2</span></span></span> et <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">3</span></span></span>.</p>\n<p class="it"><b>1.</b> Confronta <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">3</span></span> + <span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">7</span></span></span> e <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">10</span></span></span>. <br><b>2.</b> Confronta <span class="m nw">1 + <span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">2</span></span></span> e <span class="m nw"><span class="sqrt"><span class="rad">3</span></span></span>.</p>',
