EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e214', group: 'eval', num: '214', page: 111,
  title: { fr: 'Deux triangles dans un rectangle', it: 'Due triangoli in un rettangolo' },
  text: '<p class="fr">ABCD est un rectangle avec AB = 6\u00a0cm et AD = 4\u00a0cm. M est sur [BC] et N sur [CD] avec BM = CN = <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>. <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> est l’aire du triangle ABM et <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> celle du triangle ADN. <br><b>1.</b> À quel intervalle appartient <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>\u00a0? <br><b>2.</b> Exprimer <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span>. <br><b>3.</b> Montrer que <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>) = −2<i>x</i> + 12</span>. <br><b>4.</b> Pour quelles positions de M l’aire de ABM est-elle inférieure ou égale à celle de ADN\u00a0?</p>\n<p class="it">ABCD è un rettangolo con AB = 6\u00a0cm e AD = 4\u00a0cm. M è su [BC] e N su [CD] con BM = CN = <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>. <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> è l’area del triangolo ABM e <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> quella del triangolo ADN. <br><b>1.</b> A quale intervallo appartiene <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>? <br><b>2.</b> Esprimi <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span>. <br><b>3.</b> Dimostra che <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>) = −2<i>x</i> + 12</span>. <br><b>4.</b> Per quali posizioni di M l’area di ABM è minore o uguale a quella di ADN?</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<span class="cl">1.</span><span class="ce m"><i>x</i> ∈ [0\u00a0; 4]</span>\n<span class="cn"><span class="fr">M est sur [BC], qui mesure 4\u00a0cm</span><span class="it inl">M è su [BC], che misura 4\u00a0cm</span></span>\n<span class="cl">2.</span><span class="cg m"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span><i>AB</i> × <i>BM</i></span><span>2</span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span>6<i>x</i></span><span>2</span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= 3<i>x</i></span>\n<span class="cl">3.</span><span class="cg m"><i>DN</i></span><span class="cd m">= 6 − <i>x</i>,</span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"><span class="ui"><span class="fr">donc</span><span class="it">quindi</span></span> <i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span><i>AD</i> × <i>DN</i></span><span>2</span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span>4(6 − <i>x</i>)</span><span>2</span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= −2<i>x</i> + 12</span>\n<span class="cl">4.</span><span class="cg m">3<i>x</i></span><span class="cd m">≤ −2<i>x</i> + 12</span>\n<span class="cl eqv">⇔</span><span class="cg m">5<i>x</i></span><span class="cd m">≤ 12</span>\n<span class="cl eqv">⇔</span><span class="cg m"><i>x</i></span><span class="cd m">≤ 2,4</span>\n</div>\n<p class="fr">L’aire de ABM est inférieure ou égale à celle de ADN quand BM est entre 0 et 2,4\u00a0cm.</p>\n<p class="it">L’area di ABM è minore o uguale a quella di ADN quando BM è compreso tra 0 e 2,4\u00a0cm.</p>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e226', group: 'eval', num: '226', page: 113,
  title: { fr: 'Divisible par 3', it: 'Divisibile per 3' },
  text: '<p class="fr">Montrer que, pour tout entier naturel <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>, le nombre <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span> est divisible par 3.</p>\n<p class="it">Dimostra che, per ogni numero naturale <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>, il numero <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span> è divisibile per 3.</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      hint: '<p class="fr">Factorise par <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">Raccogli <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span>.</p>',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span><span class="cd m">= 4<sup><i>n</i></sup> × 4 − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup> × 1</span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= 4<sup><i>n</i></sup>(4 − 1)</span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= 3 × 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span>\n</div>\n<p class="fr">C’est 3 fois un entier\u00a0: le nombre est divisible par 3. Un exemple (<span class="m nw"><i>n</i> = 1</span>\u00a0: <span class="m nw">16 − 4 = 12</span>) ne suffirait pas, il faut ce calcul valable pour tout <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">È 3 volte un intero: il numero è divisibile per 3. Un esempio (<span class="m nw"><i>n</i> = 1</span>: <span class="m nw">16 − 4 = 12</span>) non basterebbe, serve questo calcolo valido per ogni <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>.</p>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e227', group: 'eval', num: '227', page: 113,
  title: { fr: 'Une drôle de fraction', it: 'Una strana frazione' },
  text: '<p class="fr"><span class="m nw"><i>a</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>c</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> sont des réels tels que <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span> = <span class="frac"><span><i>c</i></span><span><i>d</i></span></span></span>, avec <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span> et <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> non nuls et <span class="m nw"><i>b</i> + <i>d</i> ≠ 0</span>. La fraction <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> est-elle égale à <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>\u00a0?</p>\n<p class="it"><span class="m nw"><i>a</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>c</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> sono numeri reali tali che <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span> = <span class="frac"><span><i>c</i></span><span><i>d</i></span></span></span>, con <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span> e <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> non nulli e <span class="m nw"><i>b</i> + <i>d</i> ≠ 0</span>. La frazione <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> è uguale a <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>?</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      hint: '<p class="fr">Appelle <span class="m nw"><i>k</i></span> la valeur commune\u00a0: <span class="m nw"><i>a</i> = <i>kb</i></span> et <span class="m nw"><i>c</i> = <i>kd</i></span>. Teste d’abord avec <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>6</span></span></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">Chiama <span class="m nw"><i>k</i></span> il valore comune: <span class="m nw"><i>a</i> = <i>kb</i></span> e <span class="m nw"><i>c</i> = <i>kd</i></span>. Prova prima con <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>6</span></span></span>.</p>',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span><i>kb</i> + <i>kd</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span><i>k</i>(<i>b</i> + <i>d</i>)</span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= <i>k</i></span>\n<span class="cl"></span><span class="cg m"></span><span class="cd m">= <span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span>\n</div>\n<p class="fr">Oui, c’est toujours vrai (exemple\u00a0: <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span>1 + 3</span><span>2 + 6</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>4</span><span>8</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span>). Attention, cela ne veut pas dire qu’on additionne les fractions ainsi\u00a0: cela ne marche que parce que les deux fractions sont égales.</p>\n<p class="it">Sì, è sempre vero (esempio: <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span>1 + 3</span><span>2 + 6</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>4</span><span>8</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span>). Attenzione, non significa che le frazioni si sommano così: funziona solo perché le due frazioni sono uguali.</p>' }
  ]
});
